#: ../../source/regexpu-core_README.md:3
msgid ""
"_regexpu_ is a source code transpiler that enables the use of ES2015 "
"Unicode regular expressions in JavaScript-of-today (ES5)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/regexpu-core_README.md:5
msgid ""
"_regexpu-core_ contains _regexpu_’s core functionality, i.e. "
"`rewritePattern(pattern, flag)`, which enables rewriting regular "
"expressions that make use of [the ES2015 `u` "
"flag](https://mathiasbynens.be/notes/es6-unicode-regex) into equivalent "
"ES5-compatible regular expression patterns."
msgstr ""

